"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">素敵なお花をありがとうございます。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">6</span><span class=\"s2\">月</span><span class=\"s1\">23</span><span class=\"s2\">日</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">「黒い羊」個別握手会</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">1</span><span class=\"s2\">・</span><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\">部の参加でした！！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-07-19/30080_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_2726.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-07-19/30080_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_2735.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">外ハネ〜</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">いただいたお花です</span><span class=\"s4\">❁︎</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-07-19/30080_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3562.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">空色多め♪明るい色もなかなか頂かないので嬉しかったです♪</span></span